[{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0429","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0429.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0244","title":"Livingston RADIUS 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Livingston RADIUS 实现存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，未经认证的远程攻击者可通过向 RADIUS 认证服务发送特制数据包触发缓冲区溢出，导致以 root 权限执行任意代码。该漏洞影响多个 Livingston 版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。建议升级至最新版本或部署访问控制列表限制 RADIUS 服务访问。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0244"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-12-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:59Z","remediation":"立即升级 Livingston RADIUS 至 2.0 及以上版本，该版本修复了 RADIUS 代码中的栈缓冲区溢出漏洞。对于无法升级的旧系统，应在边界防火墙上限制对 RADIUS UDP 端口 1812/1645 的访问来源，仅允许受信任的 NAS 设备 IP 接入。建议迁移至当前仍受支持的 RADIUS 实现（如 FreeRADIUS 3.x），并在运行 RADIUS 服务的主机上启用栈缓冲区溢出保护机制（如 ASLR、NX）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0244","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/34851454a7b07498072de47d56f63daa4a4f524d/1999/CVE-1999-0244.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/ab6ab436962e16237b21ed9d4458dafc38c692fc/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0244.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0244","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0244.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/a55bddfc5dd568e972e08b703ab596ed3580b7ba/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0244.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0244.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0244.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--4912a395-3fc6-4764-84b7-7d315af3698f.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0429.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0376","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0376.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0193","title":"3Com 路由器 TCP 零长选项拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Ascend 与 3Com 路由器在处理特殊构造的 TCP 数据包时存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者无需身份认证即可向目标路由器发送包含零长度 TCP 选项（Zero Length TCP Option）的恶意数据包，触发设备处理异常导致路由器强制重启或崩溃。该漏洞影响 Ascend R 4.5 Ci12 及部分 3Com 路由器版本，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中等。目前厂商已发布固件更新修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0193"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1997-12-01T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:52Z","remediation":"建议升级 Ascend Router 固件至 4.5 Ci12 之后的修复版本，或升级 3Com 路由器至厂商发布的修补固件。若暂时无法升级，可在边界防火墙配置规则丢弃 TCP 选项长度为 0 的异常数据包，同时启用 TCP 状态检测功能缓解攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0193","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20332","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/1421f0a4349d5d46275cadd9c7c62349edf9c8bb/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0193.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0193","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0193.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0193.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/db45dbc75ff0264d63b603291e4a83d7361bd7ba/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0193.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/79c2cf4630fcc44f2632735de08432a07cfaf204/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5p2w-742f-cg75/GHSA-5p2w-742f-cg75.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/d21eb36f6164170df89822577def7df5351966d2/nvdcve/CVE-1999-0193.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154500_154600.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000239.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0376.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0056","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0056.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0016","title":"多厂商 TCP Land 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Land 攻击是一种经典的拒绝服务攻击方式。攻击者向目标主机发送一个特制的 TCP SYN 数据包，其中源 IP 地址、源端口与目的 IP 地址、目的端口完全相同。目标主机收到后试图与自己建立 TCP 连接，导致操作系统陷入无限自应答循环，最终耗尽 CPU 资源造成系统崩溃或挂起。该漏洞影响 Windows NT 4.0、Linux 2.0.34 以下版本、FreeBSD 2.2.6 以下版本、HP-UX、NetBSD 等多个主流操作系统。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0016"],"sources":["cve","exploitdb"],"published":"1997-12-01T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级到已修复版本：Windows NT 4.0 安装 Service Pack 4 及以上，Linux 升级内核至 2.0.34 及以上，FreeBSD 升级至 2.2.6 及以上，NetBSD 升级至 1.3.2 及以上，HP-UX 安装对应 PHNE 补丁。临时缓解措施：在边界防火墙/路由器上配置 ACL 策略，丢弃源 IP 与目的 IP 相同的入站 TCP SYN 数据包，同时启用基于 RFC 2827 的入口过滤以防止 IP 地址欺骗。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www1.itrc.hp.com/service/cki/docDisplay.do?docId=HPSBUX9801-076","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20170815-0001/","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20814","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/34851454a7b07498072de47d56f63daa4a4f524d/1999/CVE-1999-0016.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/1fb9a053a31c41206e693c4b4856611d722d4df7/1999/CVE-1999-0016.json","https://github.com/mthcht/awesome-lists/blob/20bccdfe36ad7e2a6c15ebfa83f10e46b5864396/Lists/Others/Defender_yara_rules/Win32/Exploit/CVE-1999-0016.yara","https://github.com/roadwy/DefenderYara/blob/59e39903d9e6667c7c3e55a1f2887f1faab0e423/Exploit/Win32/CVE-1999-0016/Exploit_Win32_CVE-1999-0016_MR_MTB.yar","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/bef4442939206e97bbfee4995afab3b6c8a2377c/1999/CVE-1999-0016/README.md","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0016","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/c8b30957414aefbd6ba0b766db0d40593ba36fba/references/CVE-1999-0016-2023-09-21-1730","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/36c16d53eb6071e39cfc3cf88e99f1b340ec913b/data/year/1999.txt","https://github.com/diannaofengzi/POC/blob/14d504f7488db9229f6f02be54aab53e3cfee0dc/databases/1999/database/CVE-1999-0016/CVE-1999-0016-POC-Pommaq.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest/blob/8829fba0b0ee59d68a105191067da3a7b4aa27de/references/contrib1-CVE-1999-0016-2025-03-17-1422","https://github.com/pexmee/CVE-1999-0016-Land-DOS-tool","https://github.com/Pommaq/CVE-1999-0016-POC"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0056.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1429","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1429.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1257","title":"Xyplex Terminal Server 安全绕过漏洞","description":"Xyplex terminal server 6.0.1S1 及可能其他版本存在安全绕过漏洞，远程攻击者无需认证即可通过输入 CTRL-Z 字符或问号（?）绕过密码提示符，直接获取未授权访问权限。该漏洞利用方式简单，攻击条件低，可导致敏感信息泄露或系统被非法控制，影响范围涉及使用该设备的网络环境。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1257"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-11-26T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:03Z","remediation":"立即将 Xyplex terminal server 设备替换为仍在厂商支持生命周期内的终端服务器产品，从根本上消除风险。在完成替换前，在边界防火墙上严格限制可访问该终端服务器 TCP 端口（默认 23/Telnet）的源 IP 地址范围，仅允许受信任的管理网段访问，并在服务器端启用 TACACS+ 或 RADIUS 等外部认证机制作为密码验证的增强补充。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/8134","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1825","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1826","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/50269681ee58c9b5bf7169b73546eef94697389c/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1257.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1257","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1257.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/4631642e37ce9ee8b9057e387df4aee61487fb70/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1257.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/f37077e857e7a28bab83d284c23299407fb1af7e/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-x5qw-j8m6-38mj/GHSA-x5qw-j8m6-38mj.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1257.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154500_154600.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--948185a2-65fd-4e22-96bc-ab4110bc58d1.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idbypass","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1429.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0396","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0396.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0210","title":"Sun Solaris automountd 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Solaris 2.5.1 系统中的 automountd 自动挂载守护进程存在命令注入漏洞，本地或远程攻击者可通过在特制参数中嵌入 shell 元字符触发该漏洞，以 root 权限执行任意命令，实现权限提升。该漏洞影响 Solaris 2.5.1 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。目前已存在公开的本地权限提升利用代码。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0210"],"sources":["redhat"],"published":"1997-11-26T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:55Z","remediation":"升级 Solaris 系统至 2.6 及以上版本，或安装 Sun 官方安全补丁 105403-05（SPARC）/105404-05（x86）。临时缓解措施：在 /etc/init.d/autofs 中禁用 automount 服务（chkconfig autofs off），或限制本地用户执行 mount 操作的权限。配置 /etc/auto_master 避免使用含通配符的自动挂载映射项。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=88053459921223&w=2","http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=91547759121289&w=2","http://www.cert.org/advisories/CA-99-05-statd-automountd.html","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/235","http://www1.itrc.hp.com/service/cki/docDisplay.do?docId=HPSBUX9910-104","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19199","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/1999/CVE-1999-0210.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/b5b2b32751baccad543d82143784e310554463ae/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0210.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0210","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/affa68d6539dbc90b6b6e0e1e746facb4aae08df/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0210.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0210.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1721417c5dc7c1cbf858e5ea5a5245ea62e70cce/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-63gj-m3j5-p47q/GHSA-63gj-m3j5-p47q.json","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/R/rpc_automountd.nasl","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154500_154600.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0396.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1397","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1397.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1209","title":"{\"_meta\":{},\"stopReason\":\"end_turn\",\"usage\":{\"cachedReadTokens\":1728,\"inputTokens\":9085,\"outputTokens\":25,\"totalTokens\":10838}}","description":"SCO OpenServer 5.0 及 SCO Open Desktop/Open Server 3.0 的 scoterm 组件存在权限许可和访问控制漏洞，本地攻击者可利用 scoterm 组件的权限配置缺陷，通过特定操作提升权限获取 root 权限。该漏洞影响 SCO OpenServer 5.0 及 SCO Open Desktop/Open Server 3.0 版本，攻击者需具备本地访问权限，利用 scoterm 组件的权限配置缺陷实现本地提权，CVSS 评分 7.2，危害等级高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1209"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-11-20T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:57Z","remediation":"建议升级 scoterm 至 SCO 官方发布的已修复版本，或应用厂商提供的安全补丁。若暂无法升级，应移除 scoterm 程序的 setuid root 权限（chmod u-s /usr/bin/X11/scoterm），或通过文件权限限制仅授权用户执行，以阻断本地用户借此提权至 root。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=88131151000069&w=2","http://www.cert.org/vendor_bulletins/VB-97.14.scoterm","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/690"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1397.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1398","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1398.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1210","title":"Digital UNIX xterm 符号链接任意文件写入漏洞","description":"Digital UNIX 4.0B 打补丁包 5 的 xterm 存在本地任意文件写入漏洞。当 xterm 在 DISPLAY 环境变量设置为无法访问的显示设备时被调用，会创建核心转储文件，本地攻击者可通过符号链接攻击该核心转储文件覆盖系统任意文件。攻击者需具备本地访问权限且能控制 DISPLAY 环境变量，利用符号链接将核心转储重定向至敏感文件路径实现任意文件覆盖，CVSS 评分 7.2，属高危本地权限提升漏洞。影响 Digital UNIX 4.0B 补丁包 5 版本的 xterm 组件。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1210"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-11-12T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:57Z","remediation":"建议立即移除 /usr/bin/X11/xterm 的 setuid root 权限（chmod u-s /usr/bin/X11/xterm），并引导用户改用 dxterm 作为替代终端。Digital UNIX 4.0B 补丁包 5 引入的 xterm 替换版本存在该缺陷，卸载补丁包 5 或回滚至未打补丁的 xterm 版本可彻底修复。如无法立即回滚，设置核心转储目录限制（ulimit -c 0 或配置 core_pattern 限制写入目录）可作为临时缓解措施防止符号链接攻击覆盖系统文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-19T00:00:00Z","references":["http://marc.info/?l=bugtraq&m=87936891504885&w=2","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/613","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7e65fa522cff0172990568230ff9b719b8650296/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1210.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1210","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-1999-1210.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/f6fc85c731fb3018b2c4fbe9aed66186edd5321b/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1210.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/5d945305f2cad48b7bb06af582393a58c31555d3/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-rx4w-gvh4-qffg/GHSA-rx4w-gvh4-qffg.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x89000/88938/info.html","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/63d4031680b3d3fa77b826660a1e30ffc70ff5cd/nvdcve/CVE-1999-1210.json","https://github.com/KTZgraph/sarenka/blob/f1fb931ab722d6c096d581ed6e3c5966d799fbaa/sarenka/feeds/cve_details/cve_all_details_154500_154600.json","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--6dd60685-4205-4be1-9eda-b8523ea6b2a4.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1398.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1516","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1516.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1428","title":"Sun Solaris Solstice AdminSuite 权限提升漏洞","description":"Solaris Solstice AdminSuite（AdminSuite）2.1 及 2.2 版本中的 Database Manager（数据库管理器）存在权限提升漏洞。该组件以 setgid bin 权限运行，导致本地用户可通过其保存选项（save option）获取 bin 组权限，从而实现权限提升。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限才能利用，影响范围覆盖 Solaris 操作系统平台。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1428"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-11-10T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:25Z","remediation":"立即应用 Sun Security Bulletin #145 提供的补丁，升级 Solstice AdminSuite 至修复版本。如无法升级，以 root 身份执行 `chmod g-s /usr/bin/db_manager` 移除 Database Manager 的 setgid bin 权限位，作为临时缓解措施。同时限制可登录主机的本地用户范围，仅授权可信用户访问。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/145","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/208","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/48e2428aa9b9856f01006cca01971bc2ae076616/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1428.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1428","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1428.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/715601c34bbee046275188561ed6152c0e14bde6/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1428.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/664f1b641010bd1f3bc1d11a60ca29d1f4a0e4ca/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-g9fg-7hcw-v5h7/GHSA-g9fg-7hcw-v5h7.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1428.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/208/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--6648cbba-8286-4f75-8241-70e22526bbc6.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_gainpre.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1516.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1515","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1515.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1427","title":"Sun Solaris Solstice AdminSuite 不安全锁文件创建本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Solaris Solstice AdminSuite 2.1 及 2.2 版本存在不安全锁文件创建漏洞。由于程序在创建锁文件时未正确设置文件权限，本地攻击者可利用符号链接攻击等方式操纵锁文件，从而覆盖系统关键文件或提升权限至 root。该漏洞影响 Solaris 操作系统上的 AdminSuite 组件，攻击者需拥有本地访问权限，CVSS 评分 6.2，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1427"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-11-10T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:25Z","remediation":"升级 Solaris Solstice AdminSuite 至 2.3 及以上版本，或安装 Sun 官方补丁 106900-01（SPARC）/ 106901-01（x86）。临时缓解措施：以 root 身份运行 `chmod 1777 /var/tmp /tmp` 确保临时目录 sticky-bit 生效；在运行 AdminSuite 工具前执行 `umask 077` 限制锁文件权限；移除受影响的 AdminSuite 软件包中无需的 setuid 程序（如 `/usr/sbin/admintool`）的执行权限。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/145","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/208","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/48e2428aa9b9856f01006cca01971bc2ae076616/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1427.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1427","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1427.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/715601c34bbee046275188561ed6152c0e14bde6/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1427.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/664f1b641010bd1f3bc1d11a60ca29d1f4a0e4ca/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-74vh-2872-x5h4/GHSA-74vh-2872-x5h4.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1427.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/208/info.html","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000233.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--7f6e6079-1327-4b01-9143-703ef349fe29.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1515.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1514","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1514.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1426","title":"Sun Solaris Solstice AdminSuite 符号链接任意文件写入漏洞","description":"Solaris Solstice AdminSuite (AdminSuite) 2.1 在更新 NIS 数据库时未正确处理符号链接，导致存在任意文件写入漏洞。本地攻击者可通过创建恶意符号链接，诱使 AdminSuite 将数据写入目标文件，从而实现任意文件覆盖或篡改。该漏洞影响 Solaris 系统上的 AdminSuite 2.1 版本，CVSS 评分 6.2，危害等级中危。攻击者需拥有本地系统访问权限，利用难度较低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1426"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-11-10T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:24Z","remediation":"安装 Sun Security Bulletin #00145 提供的修补程序，升级 Solstice AdminSuite 至包含符号链接检查的更新版本；如无法升级，限制不可信用户的本地登录，并监控 NIS 数据库更新操作中的异常文件写入行为。对于仍在运行的遗留系统，建议迁移至受支持的 Solaris 版本并启用 Solaris Trusted Extensions 以加强权限控制。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/145","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/208","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/48e2428aa9b9856f01006cca01971bc2ae076616/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1426.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1426","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1426.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/715601c34bbee046275188561ed6152c0e14bde6/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1426.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/664f1b641010bd1f3bc1d11a60ca29d1f4a0e4ca/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-552p-f4h5-wjj9/GHSA-552p-f4h5-wjj9.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1426.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/208/info.html","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000232.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--037a5137-0f49-4f5e-bf01-dec515601e9c.json","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1514.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1513","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1513.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1425","title":"Solaris Solstice AdminSuite 文件权限配置不当导致本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Solaris Solstice AdminSuite (AdminSuite) 2.1 版本在安装过程中错误地设置了 NIS 映射源文件的写权限，导致本地攻击者可通过修改 /etc/passwd 文件添加或变更用户账户信息，进而实现权限提升。该漏洞影响 Solaris 系统，攻击者需拥有本地访问权限，利用门槛较低。CVSS 评分 6.2，危害等级为中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1425"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-11-10T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:24Z","remediation":"升级 Solaris Solstice AdminSuite 至 2.1 以上已修复版本，或手动修正 NIS 映射源文件权限为 600（仅 root 可读写），同时限制本地非授权用户登录系统，并定期审计 /etc/passwd 文件完整性。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/145","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/208","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/51c6246292cd60528ab00cc0df9c1fcdee341e7e/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1425.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1425","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1425.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6c772403a169ecbfd38454bff1a2ab85bf6a7d51/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1425.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/664f1b641010bd1f3bc1d11a60ca29d1f4a0e4ca/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-frq9-hfh5-8mmm/GHSA-frq9-hfh5-8mmm.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1425.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/208/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--dc301b0d-71cc-46ba-bc3e-de327e670206.json","https://github.com/Yuning-J/VulnerabilityClassifier/blob/c0f06c21b73c26b5ee2b75c21a498eb04eada4b5/threatPrediction/cveIDThreatType/cve_idgainpre","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_gainpre.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1513.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1512","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1512.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1424","title":"Solaris Solstice AdminSuite 本地权限提升漏洞","description":"Solaris Solstice AdminSuite 2.1 在向 NIS+ 密码表添加新用户时使用了不安全的文件权限设置，导致本地攻击者可通过修改自身的密码表条目来获取 root 权限。该漏洞允许拥有系统普通账户权限的用户利用权限配置缺陷提升至超级用户权限，影响 Solaris 操作系统的安全性和完整性。由于攻击需要本地访问权限，CVSS 评分为 6.2，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1424"],"sources":["avd"],"published":"1997-11-10T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:50:24Z","remediation":"及时应用 Sun Security Bulletin #145（Sun 安全公告 145）中提供的 Solaris Solstice AdminSuite 补丁。对于 Solstice AdminSuite 2.1 及 2.2 版本，建议升级到修复此权限问题的后续版本。如无法升级，临时缓解措施为手动检查 /etc/nsswitch.conf 中 NIS+ 配置，收紧 NIS+ 口令表（passwd table）的权限设置，确保只有 root 用户具备写入权限，并移除不必要的本地用户登录权限以降低攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://sunsolve.sun.com/pub-cgi/retrieve.pl?doctype=coll&doc=secbull/145","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/208","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/51c6246292cd60528ab00cc0df9c1fcdee341e7e/cves/1999/1xxx/CVE-1999-1424.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-1424","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/470a5f1c0d1bd36cd0a6327cda49cf96a1474588/content/CVE-1999-1424.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/6c772403a169ecbfd38454bff1a2ab85bf6a7d51/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-1424.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/664f1b641010bd1f3bc1d11a60ca29d1f4a0e4ca/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-c44g-fjhj-p52w/GHSA-c44g-fjhj-p52w.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-1424.json","https://github.com/SpeeDr00t/speedr00t.github.com/blob/0380f0c2190556fabe90257cb6c0034a42f68951/securityfocus/0x1000/208/info.html","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3c423751-1219-47a1-85cb-16fa645fb820.json","https://github.com/Ethishh/securin_assessment/blob/e6ce9197b6593ae46f3f5646d268181eea6cbb31/cve_sync.log","https://github.com/Vasileios-Mavroeidis/semantic-stix-vulnerability/blob/30f07606133364b9623f401bc306c8c9cbcf9386/vulnerability/vulnerability--3c423751-1219-47a1-85cb-16fa645fb820.owl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1512.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1234","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1234.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1069","title":"iCat Carbo Server 目录遍历漏洞","description":"iCat Carbo Server 3.0.0 中的 carbo.dll 组件存在目录遍历漏洞，远程攻击者无需认证即可向 icatcommand 参数传递包含 `../` 序列的恶意请求，绕过路径限制读取服务器上的任意文件，导致数据库配置、源代码等敏感信息泄露。该漏洞攻击复杂度低，影响 iCat Electronic Commerce Suite 3.0 版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1069"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1997-11-08T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:39Z","remediation":"iCat Carbo Server 3.0.0 已停止维护，厂商不再提供安全更新。建议立即迁移至受支持的电子商务平台（如 Magento、Shopify 等）。如无法迁移，可在 Web 服务器（IIS/Apache）层面添加 URL 重写规则，拦截 icatcommand 参数中包含 ../ 或 ..%2f 等目录遍历序列的请求，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/archive/1/7943","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/2126","https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/1620","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/20513"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1234.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0068","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0068.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0021","title":"Muhammad A. Muquit wwwcount 远程缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"wwwcount 的 Count.cgi 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过向目标 Web 服务器发送特制的 HTTP 请求触发该漏洞，导致任意命令执行。该漏洞影响 wwwcount 2.3 及更早版本，攻击无需身份认证，危害等级高，CVSS 评分 7.5。通过向 Count.cgi 传入超长参数即可触发栈溢出，从而实现远程代码执行或拒绝服务。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0021"],"sources":["exploitdb"],"published":"1997-11-05T05:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:47:22Z","remediation":"升级 wwwcount 至 2.4 及以上版本，或从 CGI 目录移除 Count.cgi 脚本。若无法升级，在 Web 服务器层面添加输入过滤规则，限制对 Count.cgi 的参数长度（如 Apache ModSecurity 限制 QUERY_STRING 不超过 256 字节），并确保以最低权限运行 CGI 程序。同时可在 Web 服务器访问控制中限制 Count.cgi 仅允许信任的来源 IP 调用，降低被远程利用的风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/128","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19105","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/dc83b9e6d88de194a14e3020b4e71ac42054e609/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0021.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0021","https://github.com/aquasecurity/vuln-list-redhat/blob/601a95d57be2a57306cd88389c2251f34b2fbcc1/csaf-vex/1999/cve-1999-0021.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/9074597bd191efd66c2a6bf1f5d8e60bc4801a90/content/CVE-1999-0021.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/04a84e78299e2aeaab4d2594fc26f920778c7b06/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0021.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1b2e09705f0816776a0a8a0cd6fc1208d25f09b2/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-jfr4-hpqv-2pq4/GHSA-jfr4-hpqv-2pq4.json","https://github.com/xqcyberscore/nvt/blob/978f6a9acb495d7d669239530ffe6da5d631f4da/pre2008/count_cgi.nasl","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/web-cgi.rules","https://github.com/bailehang/snort_2.2.0/blob/34f8a3a85f15645aea53d6e0d46863c7c57e43ef/doc/signatures/1149.txt","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0068.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0511","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0511.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0306","title":"HP-UX xlock 本地缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"HP-UX 系统中的 xlock 程序存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可以通过向 xlock 程序发送特制的输入数据触发缓冲区溢出，导致攻击者能够以 root 权限执行任意代码，从而完全控制受影响的系统。攻击者需要拥有本地系统访问权限才能利用此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.2,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0306"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1997-11-04T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 HP-UX 系统至包含安全补丁的最新版本，限制非授权用户对 xlock 程序的执行权限，并监控系统日志中的异常提权行为。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T12:15:41Z","references":["https://exchange.xforce.ibmcloud.com/vulnerabilities/CVE-1999-0306"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0511.toml"}]